{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a neon-lit dystopia full of exciting challenges in Nion Forge - the action-packed <strong>cyberpunk roguelite</strong>! Here you have the opportunity to <strong>build your own spaceship</strong> and fight above the dystopian streets as you face off against hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be surprised by unique upgrades and weapons that make every playthrough a new experience. Only by selecting the best ship parts can you master all 9 city districts and defeat their bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Will you be the first fighter to escape the city arena and attain your freedom?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/panel_steam_build.png?t=1745018476\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Agile or powerful? What weapons, what drive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your ship to suit your style and be better prepared next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/nf_2025_04_hangar_compr120.gif?t=1745018476\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/panel_steam_fight.png?t=1745018476\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face ever-growing hordes of enemies and battle until you're ready for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat all 9 levels and bosses within a limited time to escape the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/nf_wide_district_gameplay_compr200.gif?t=1745018476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/nf_wide_boss02_compr120.gif?t=1745018476\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/panel_steam_collect.png?t=1745018476\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies drop valuable materials,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">which you can trade between escape attempts for over 100 different ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/nf_wide_black_market_compr0.gif?t=1745018476\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay in the loop and play the first Demo on May 17!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2954090?t=1745018476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745018476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/6c3a5e54a4e5ea770fa55d54a7879a3028cb2130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745018476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/6c3a5e54a4e5ea770fa55d54a7879a3028cb2130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745018476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a neon-lit dystopia full of exciting challenges in Nion Forge - the action-packed <strong>cyberpunk roguelite</strong>! Here you have the opportunity to <strong>build your own spaceship</strong> and fight above the dystopian streets as you face off against hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be surprised by unique upgrades and weapons that make every playthrough a new experience. Only by selecting the best ship parts can you master all 9 city districts and defeat their bosses.</p><p clas